AB  - This open letter, signed by a coalition of civil society organizations and individuals, urges EU AI Act negotiators to reject the legalization of dangerous and discriminatory police AI. The letter highlights concerns about governments and lobbyists pressuring lawmakers to compromise fundamental rights and freedoms by allowing predictive policing, biometric categorization, and emotion recognition technologies. These tools are criticized for being ineffective, rooted in discriminatory premises, and enabling mass surveillance. The signatories call for adherence to human rights laws and the rejection of proposals that would undermine the rule of law.
