AB  - US Ignite collaborates with the Department of Defense (DoD) to bring smart city capabilities to military installations, modernizing operations and creating effective Smart Base solutions. They leverage expertise in managing large-scale laboratories and partner with defense research groups, academia, and the commercial sector. US Ignite manages three Smart Base testbeds (Fort Carson, Fort Benning, and MCAS Miramar) to promote dual-use development of commercial technologies, focusing on problem identification, solution development, and performance measurement. Select project examples include inclement weather decision support, energy communications via 5G, and automated shuttle services.
