AB  - This presentation outlines the U.S. Army's strategic approach to modernization, emphasizing the need for "Installations Supporting Modernization" to enable future multi-domain operations. It details how installations must evolve into agile, flexible, and interoperable platforms, akin to smart city environments, to support new weapon systems, networked capabilities, and technological advancements. Key themes include making installations adaptable, scalable, and capable of providing enhanced training, security, and Soldier support. The document highlights the importance of energy resilience and leveraging smart technologies like IoT for predictive maintenance, cost savings, and improved operational readiness, concluding that modern installations are critical for a modern Army.
